Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.58,0:01:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.86,0:01:45.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did not have the figurine on him
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:47.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says he already sold it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.98,0:01:49.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...to a man named Kijima
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what he told me.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.76,0:01:57.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(627.4,971.2)\fnPapyrus\fs50}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.26,0:02:01.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(450,620.8)\fnPapyrus\fs60}The Worth of a Maid's Fist and Pancreas!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.36,0:02:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um Ronco would um one of these help I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.84,0:02:13.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thought your hair might be in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.98,0:02:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh you can take whichever one\Nyou like I shall borrow this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.46,0:02:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No please you can have it\Nthat's much appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to Oinkie Doink Cafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.76,0:02:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please come visit our cafe, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nogomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.96,0:02:36.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did something good happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.68,0:02:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nerula!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.86,0:02:39.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I would say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.46,0:02:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of our way, lowlifes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.06,0:02:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, a maid just\Ntried to give me a flyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.96,0:02:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope she doesn't try to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.96,0:02:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, precious Gracie Poo,\Nwhat an unruly town this is!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.72,0:02:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nerula, who are those people?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.94,0:02:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're from an anime figurine company.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.16,0:03:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've heard that they're known for\Nbuying and selling premium figurines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.08,0:03:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me the fake, Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:06.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.24,0:03:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An amateur would never be\Nable to tell the difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.38,0:03:12.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll sell that one for a high price.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.02,0:03:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sweet little Gracie Poole,\Ndon't you worry at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.72,0:03:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let anyone touch a\Nsingle hair on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:20.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's best if we stay far away from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.88,0:03:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wanting a rohamptic time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to Oinky Doink Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.48,0:03:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think I'm threatened\Nby some trashy maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.82,0:03:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could take over your\Ncheesy cafe just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.58,0:03:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some trashy what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.48,0:03:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should the maids be initiating violence?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.38,0:03:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because I am a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.92,0:03:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.83,0:03:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't simply back down after\Nbeing insulted like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.24,0:03:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maids should be cute by nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.26,0:03:59.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you call yourself a maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.80,0:04:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, foreigner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Tyra send you here to collect me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.52,0:04:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am here to escort you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.66,0:04:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I refuse to acknowledge\Nyou as a true maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.96,0:04:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.90,0:04:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You all look awfully vivacious\Nfor a bunch of hogs that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,haven't paid back any of the\Nhoney money that you owe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.26,0:04:34.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given how much trouble you've caused,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.26,0:04:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you can't possibly complain no matter\Nwhat kind of job we ask you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's get down to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.36,0:04:44.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how much water do\Nyou expect me to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.42,0:04:46.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't have all that\Nsloshing around in my gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.64,0:04:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.56,0:04:49.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna spew this shit out all over you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hold on now, that's quite an\Nimpressive body you've got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.88,0:04:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manager!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.79,0:04:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, whatever you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:59.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have something in mind that would be\Nperfect for your water-pouring porker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.34,0:05:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's negotiate terms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.16,0:05:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet it's another high-risk job.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.54,0:05:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to worry about a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.96,0:05:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't call myself manager\Nif I can't protect my piglets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One last thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.38,0:05:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eggs left in the fridge, they're past\Ntheir expiration, but they're still good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.24,0:05:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.36,0:05:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, where's Ronco, Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.62,0:05:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She went straight to the venue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.38,0:05:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd better head over there, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.24,0:05:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll cross Monsei Bridge, in the opposite\Ndirection, towards a successful tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you made her take the job after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.40,0:05:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.31,0:05:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But earlier you said a manager's\Nsupposed to protect her staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.10,0:05:48.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind's blowing our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.56,0:05:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko's on board, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.28,0:05:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.19,0:05:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.66,0:05:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Akiba Fluffy and Sweet Club.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.79,0:05:57.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,205)\fnPapyrus\fs50}The Akiba Fluffy Light n' Sweet Club
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, how cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:06:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the job a live gig or something? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One that pumps you chock\Nfull of adrenaline.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.98,0:06:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw her a hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:17.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know how much I bet on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.36,0:06:19.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,205)\fnPapyrus\fs80}The Akiba Fluffy Light n' Sweet Club
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.83,0:06:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Akiba Fluffy and Sweet Club?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.98,0:06:20.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,205)\fnPapyrus\fs80\alpha&HFF&}The Akiba {\alpha&H00&}F{\alpha&HFF&}luffy {\alpha&H00&}Light n' Sweet Club
Dialogue: 1,0:06:20.86,0:06:23.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(518,205)\fnPapyrus\fs80\alpha&HFF&}The Akiba {\alpha&H00&}F{\alpha&HFF&}luffy L{\alpha&H00&}ight {\alpha&HFF&}n' Sweet {\alpha&H00&}Club
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.22,0:06:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, take your places.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.80,0:06:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.71,0:06:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're going to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.66,0:06:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.54,0:06:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:38.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A maid shouldn't have to do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.40,0:06:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting for the sake of her\Ncafe is what a maid does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronco will lose in the\Nthird round by knockout.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.10,0:06:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.28,0:06:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.14,0:06:50.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ashtray.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.05,0:06:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right here, madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.66,0:06:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I practice a special breathing technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.52,0:06:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.74,0:06:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.56,0:07:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't want an eye\Npatch on your other eye,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.04,0:07:05.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'd better deliver on\Nyour end of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:09.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Madam Taira, Kijima is here\Nto show you a new figurine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.18,0:07:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're rigging it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.16,0:07:11.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, that's so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:14.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So does that mean we're just going\Nto lose and get paid for the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.90,0:07:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.81,0:07:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know the outcome as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.34,0:07:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we'll bet on the\Nopponent and rake it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.86,0:07:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, our chiefs are real genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:25.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.54,0:07:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see a new face is up against the champ.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.94,0:07:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That intimidating presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This made Ronko look promising.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pure Mucky Masami's\Nthe uncontested reigning
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.74,0:07:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,champion despite having those\Nbeautiful delicate arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.50,0:07:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in peak condition to win a\Nthird consecutive championship.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.88,0:07:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be one hell of a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.88,0:07:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uncontested champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.38,0:07:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.34,0:08:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say you're extremely fortunate,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.10,0:08:04.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Tyra This item has never\Nbeen displayed on the open market.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We barely managed to\Nacquire this one ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my Gracie-poo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.88,0:08:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Grace Inumata.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.82,0:08:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A character from the anime\NLegendary Fighter Nobuaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's one of my favorites, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.74,0:08:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though still in grade school,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:23.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's an exceptional mentor who\Nsupports Nobuaki's development.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her steadfast devotion inspired me\Nso much growing up as a young child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.80,0:08:34.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as you might know she's as minor as a\Nsub character can get there were very few
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.98,0:08:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,figurines made to begin\Nwith and that scarcity
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,escalated her price\Ntremendously she's easily
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.78,0:08:44.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,going to fetch way beyond\N10 million i'll pay
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.68,0:08:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,any price you want for\Nher it's only because
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.30,0:08:49.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of my loyal admiration for her that i was
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.32,0:08:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,able to train our\Nstarfighter to be a champion
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.14,0:09:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.70,0:09:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why on earth did you win the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.06,0:09:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.12,0:09:07.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the first round?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.34,0:09:08.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With a single punch?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said just barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.68,0:09:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you a hundred times\Nto lose in the third round!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.28,0:09:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've been in the ring, I realize\NI have difficulty pulling punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's contrary to how I've lived my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.48,0:09:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.96,0:09:25.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was the opponent unaware of the deal\Nyou made earlier with her manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must be tough creating a star in\Na world where strength is everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.18,0:09:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In any case, let us\Ndiscuss the price for gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seppo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.18,0:09:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This would have happened either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:43.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now bring those damn pigs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm asking if you have the ability to\Ncomprehend what the hell you've done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a dream. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.76,0:09:57.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to move to Hawaii and buy a tiki\Nbar and be surrounded by pretty boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.62,0:09:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So please, give us another chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.88,0:10:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get Ronko to beat everyone\Nand make it to the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.40,0:10:04.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll totally wipe out the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.70,0:10:06.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why should I want that pig to win?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.82,0:10:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the crowd is dead, sure, Ronko's\Ngoing to win it all and take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:11.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll get her ass whooped\Nin the final match.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.02,0:10:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the moment your fighter\Nwill become a shining star.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.66,0:10:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us help you create a new sensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can read the batch right probably\Nso you want to ring it right not
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,particularly just lose the finals\NYou got that right sure in theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.14,0:10:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say ma 'am?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See how committed Ronko is to our plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.14,0:10:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine get in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.10,0:10:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a sorry excuse for a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can't even smile, but she has fighting\Nskills from her military experience!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.38,0:10:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dirty swan of yours can't win\Neven if she messes with the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.34,0:10:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're a maid, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.70,0:10:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply dressed like I was a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.18,0:10:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither you nor I are\Nreal maids. Not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.62,0:10:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you put a uniform on, you have\Nthe right to be a maid no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.52,0:11:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only judge that determines if\Nyou're a maid or not is yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll go along with that\Nplan. Hey, you! Mistress Pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.36,0:11:12.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this body here and shove it in the\Ntrunk of the car in the parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you? Why are you sitting\Nthere naked? I'm devoted.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still have to fight it was\Nmy screw-up that brought us here
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:48.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after all We'll cross Monsei\NBridge in the opposite direction,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.44,0:11:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,towards a successful tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.36,0:11:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're scheming again, aren't you, Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.26,0:11:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the first step toward tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.12,0:11:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.12,0:11:57.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:56.15,0:11:57.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(173,356)\fnPapyrus\fs50}ORGANS    Fizzle Fizzle Plop
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:12:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These places loan you money and they'll\Nlet you use your organs as collateral.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.53,0:12:00.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(996.4,483.4)\fnPapyrus\fs50}I Want to Borrow Your Pancreas
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.49,0:12:05.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1475.2,311.2)\fnPapyrus\fs50}Entrail Chargers
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.82,0:12:01.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Organs?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.73,0:12:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just have to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you only need like\Nhalf a stomach to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.74,0:12:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.65,0:12:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's like borrowing money for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.31,0:12:11.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have a stomach and lung combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.44,0:12:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm witnessing a living legend\Nin the making right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.00,0:12:17.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the birth of a new star.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.42,0:12:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has to really fight\Nher to rig the match?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might as well cheer her on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.98,0:12:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko's having to break her neck in there.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.93,0:12:27.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(768,821)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}QUARTERFINALS
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.48,0:12:31.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(826,832)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}SEMIFINALS
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, ho-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.14,0:12:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Tyra, have you seen our president?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.10,0:12:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He disappeared after you asked to see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.04,0:12:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid he never showed\Nup for our appointment,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.76,0:12:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we did find this\Non our security camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.23,0:12:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that same bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.44,0:12:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should we take her out?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.38,0:12:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would interrupt the\Ntournament that's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.90,0:12:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us handle this matter for you. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise to satisfy your\Nthirst for vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.74,0:13:03.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the final bout, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:07.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dead maid tells no tales.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.08,0:13:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today you will die with the blame for\Nthis missing figurine on your shoulders,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.88,0:13:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronco Manon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.98,0:13:15.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've told Zoya to pummel\Nher to death, is that correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am, I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.08,0:13:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Ronko Manon is requesting\Nan audience with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.12,0:13:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She says she has something to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell her to go prepare for the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.24,0:13:41.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only judge that determines if you're\Na maid or not can only be yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:46.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we give the signal, take her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, only a monkey makes\Nthe same mistake twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.98,0:13:55.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the punches that come\Nyour way, and don't hit back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.08,0:13:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\Nyou're going to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:13:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to take a dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now don't forget, tell me, which round?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.94,0:14:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The 12th round.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.90,0:14:02.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.81,0:14:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.73,0:14:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.64,0:14:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.55,0:14:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go out there and\Ntake one for the team!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.90,0:14:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.24,0:14:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The final match between\Ntwo monster rookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.98,0:14:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An MMA fight with 12 rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.68,0:14:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The odds are stacked\Nin Ronco Manon's favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.20,0:14:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I doubt it'll play out that smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.14,0:14:23.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have enough organs to\Nbet all the money I want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.48,0:14:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lose the fight for the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.50,0:14:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:45.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see her punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.40,0:14:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she has to keep taking\Nall those hard glows?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.06,0:14:52.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to strike back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.38,0:14:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.29,0:14:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.36,0:15:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see tomorrow dawning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.26,0:15:02.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep this up till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.80,0:15:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way she can\Ndo this for 11 rounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That damn woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got the go-ahead, so do it. Хорошо.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.30,0:15:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.56,0:15:23.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1363,702)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}MMA 101
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.21,0:15:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back of the head?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.13,0:15:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, that's a... a nut!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a nut shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.06,0:15:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not a nut shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.22,0:15:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Hey, referee!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.08,0:15:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.50,0:15:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rocco!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.40,0:15:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ronko!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.64,0:15:45.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you about to hit her? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.50,0:15:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like she was coming in for the kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.52,0:15:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.68,0:15:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see pretty boys in my future!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.60,0:15:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize she's about to be\Nkilled for some useless petty cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.60,0:15:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.92,0:16:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be taking any more hits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.18,0:16:02.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.96,0:16:04.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The winds of Waikiki!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.64,0:16:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at you better than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.56,0:16:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call yourself a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:27.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an oinky-doink maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.18,0:16:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said cafe is full of\Nnothing but wannabe maids. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who acknowledges you as a maid\Nmust be total crap, just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.62,0:16:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.14,0:16:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a monkey makes the same\Nmistake twice, you stupid bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.22,0:17:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.13,0:17:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your paw off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.05,0:17:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sincerely apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.74,0:17:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hair tie is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have a spare one\Nin your paw, Tronco?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I have a spare one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:14.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.16,0:17:20.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.38,0:17:28.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're ready to fight me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.44,0:17:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you can't spin\Non our cafe's good name.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.26,0:17:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And think that you'll get away with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.46,0:17:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I am a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.84,0:17:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, this wasn't the deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.86,0:17:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those damn rotten pig heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:18:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap! My pancreas!\NMy pancreas! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.52,0:18:04.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please lose, Bronco!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is her deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.26,0:18:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did she really be called a maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was always denied cute\Nthings from an early age.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.54,0:18:17.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was when I discovered\Nthe world of maid
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cafes and aspired to become a maid myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.46,0:18:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the maids I envisioned in my\Nmind didn't reek of blood like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:29.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To me, they were all\Nbrightness and sparkles.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.06,0:18:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And shining with so much\Ncuteness. Yes, it was Blam.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.12,0:18:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.16,0:18:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.07,0:18:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look great! Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:54.36,0:18:56.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1336,384.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Trial Shift
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:18:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, can't you act cuter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.88,0:19:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not cut out to be a cute cafe maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know how to smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.94,0:19:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't have it. Look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You aren't cute at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.44,0:19:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.20,0:19:17.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.82,0:19:21.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I'm wearing this adorable\Nhair tie that Nagomi gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.96,0:19:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I've been against her, will\Nthat help me acknowledge myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.18,0:19:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If, like her, I can call myself cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.14,0:19:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.22,0:19:43.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.30,0:19:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Ronco.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ranko!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.38,0:19:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knock her out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ranko, you are very cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.74,0:20:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:17.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chiburashka.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.56,0:20:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.86,0:20:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.44,0:20:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.88,0:20:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chris.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.30,0:20:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My spleen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.74,0:20:38.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You pieces of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.26,0:20:39.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let those pigs out alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:40.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.69,0:20:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found this note posted on\Nyour office door. Miss Tyra,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.92,0:20:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like to tell\Nyou something about the
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,body you had me dump in\Nthe trunk of the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.06,0:20:50.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means our president was\Nhere before he disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.62,0:20:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means you must have killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:20:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two sold off your organs?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.02,0:21:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pancreas is just decorative,\Nlike window dressing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.94,0:21:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, hey, listen, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.68,0:21:09.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't that creepy Kijima guy make a\Nfortune off of selling premium figurines?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.65,0:21:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.16,0:21:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, maybe we can sell this.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.30,0:21:18.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(440,515.2)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.56,0:21:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was all for\Nnothing. We didn't even
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.62,0:21:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,manage to pay off any of our overdue dues.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.00,0:21:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least you should be\Ngrateful you got to keep
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.72,0:21:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all of your organs\Nbellyaching won't get us to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.60,0:21:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow piglets remember\Nstriking it rich starts
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one step at a time for\Nstarters i got some extra Pig
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.66,0:21:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,power i'm soya i'm the new\Nmaid joining oinky doink
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.20,0:21:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Starting today, I'll do my\Nvery best to become a cute,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.80,0:21:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,adorable maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.50,0:21:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really the same person?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.52,0:21:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cute person is surreal through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.22,0:21:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An actual live overseas hire?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.84,0:21:50.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tyra is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.14,0:21:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got her for free in the\Ndeal, no strings attached.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:55.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've finally gone international.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.26,0:22:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a total novice with no knowledge\Nto speak of, but I'll do my very best.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.16,0:22:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm counting on you to teach me, Ranko.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.96,0:22:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good to have you.
